---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Coffee in MBR City"
  description="Where to get coffee across MBR City's communities — Meydan One, the Riviera promenade, and what's community-level versus district-level."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Coffee</p>
    <h1>Coffee across the district</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Coffee coverage in MBR City splits into two kinds: what's inside your
      own community, and what's worth a short drive to Meydan One for.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Meydan One</h2>
    <p>
      The district's main concentration of cafes and coffee chains, drawing
      from across MBR City rather than just Meydan residents — the default
      answer for "where's good coffee near here" if you're not in walking
      distance of a community with its own promenade.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Inside Riviera</h2>
    <p>
      The one community with genuine walkable coffee coverage of its own —
      cafes spread along the ground-floor promenade. See
      <a href="https://riviera.dst.llc/coffee/">Riviera's own coffee page</a>
      for what's actually there.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>District One, Meydan, Sobha Hartland</h2>
    <p>
      These communities lean more heavily on Meydan One and nearby
      Business Bay/Downtown for cafes rather than having dense on-site
      coffee retail of their own — worth knowing before assuming a
      walkable coffee scene from renders alone.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

